{"id":"e4a0bc0f49167c22","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-disjoint-family.md","title":"ZFC Ideal6 Ideal Disjoint Family","display":"df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-disjoint-family — ZFC Ideal6 Ideal Disjoint Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-disjoint-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-disjoint-family"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-disjoint-family — ZFC Ideal6 Ideal Disjoint Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ideal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-disjoint-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-disjoint-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-disjoint-family — ZFC Ideal6 Ideal Disjoint Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealDisjointFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealDisjointFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealDisjointFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\notin\\mathcal I)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal6\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealDisjointFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\notin\\mathcal I)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Members are required to be <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span>-positive; without this clause, every family contained in the ideal would satisfy the pairwise-intersection condition vacuously.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":